Package: FSF
Type: Package
Title: Feature Signal Stratification
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Sajad", "Shahbazi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "sajad642008@gmail.com")
Description: Contract-only development scaffold for the Feature Signal
    Stratification framework. FSF characterizes perturbation-derived signed
    effects through Signal Identity, the Signal Stratification Index, signal
    classes, and condition-level signal architectures. Computational functions
    are intentionally not implemented in this development phase.
